# The shared-memory region is created at runtime under /tmp — nothing to ignore here.

# NOTE: the generated SharedBuffer overlays (ForestSharedBuffer.mojo and
# forest_sb/) are intentionally COMMITTED — the Dagr CLI that emits them is in
# private beta, so shipping them lets anyone build and run the demo.
